<launch>
    <!-- ====================================================================
         Ground-station entry point: Carolus + a Logitech 1080p USB webcam,
         no RoboMaster. Written 2026-08-17 to reproduce and diagnose Hector's
         report that nothing displays on his own separate build (Carolus on
         his PC and this camera); see research-log/journal.md that date.

         Deliberately not an edit to testcarolus.launch. That file is the
         documented RoboMaster S1 entry point, and its own header says so:
         "Carolus can be run on other robots without editing this file. See
         carolus.launch for that path." This is that path, taken. No
         S1-specific static TF (honey/body) here, since there is no robot.

         Prerequisite: ros-noetic-usb-cam installed
         (sudo apt install ros-noetic-usb-cam), then in a separate terminal:
             roslaunch usb_cam usb_cam-test.launch
         which publishes /usb_cam/image_raw, the topic below.
         ==================================================================== -->

    <include file="$(find carolus_node)/launch/carolus.launch">
        <arg name="config"
             value="$(find carolus_node)/config/logitech_1080p.yaml" />
        <arg name="camera_topic" value="/usb_cam/image_raw" />
    </include>

</launch>
